{"unit_id":"drliuhuan__dsh-plugin-vrmpet3d#card-zh","repo":"drliuhuan/dsh-plugin-vrmpet3d","commit":"462bda9bcdcd4d0d14a4c33ab675bffbfadbcffc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"桌宠 3D · VRM Pet 3D（DSH 网页端与 Desktop 桌宠组件）：为 DeepSeek Harness 加入随任务状态变化的 VRM 3D 宠物。插件在 DSH 客户端覆盖层显示宠物，并由主机侧同步会话边界状态、读取模型和动作目录；Desktop 环境还可启动置顶透明悬浮窗。用户可切换 VRM/glTF 模型、配置状态动作与表情、导入模型和动作、与宠物互动并玩内置弹球小游戏，也可配置预设或 AI 碎碎念。适合想在 DSH 工作时获得可自定义桌面宠物反馈的用户；图形环境需支持 WebGL2，独立窗口需要 Electron，AI 台词可选接入 DSH 模型或自定义兼容服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:5323-5324","lib/index.js:2403-2421","desktop/main.js:335-392","lib/index.js:3713-3728"]}
{"unit_id":"drliuhuan__dsh-plugin-vrmpet3d#card-en","repo":"drliuhuan/dsh-plugin-vrmpet3d","commit":"462bda9bcdcd4d0d14a4c33ab675bffbfadbcffc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"VRM Pet 3D adds a task-reactive 3D companion to DSH. It renders in the client overlay or a transparent Desktop window, supports custom models and motions, pet interactions, a mini-game, and optional AI chatter. WebGL2 is needed; the separate window uses Electron.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:5323-5324","lib/index.js:2403-2421","desktop/main.js:335-392","lib/index.js:3713-3728"]}
